h3. Context
* {{src/api.ts:13}} {{fetchCurrentUser}} rejects on any non-2xx status, and {{loadDashboard}} does not catch it.
* {{src/api.ts:27}} {{loadDashboard}} {{loadDashboard}} awaits {{fetchCurrentUser}} with no error handling. A failed request from {{fetchCurrentUser}} rejects the dashboard load, and the page never renders.
{panel}

